flowchart TD
    Evidence["Evidence refs<br/>source, claim, trace, probe, signal"] --> Vector["Score vector snapshot<br/>typed dimensions"]
    Space["Score space definition<br/>schema + normalization"] --> Vector
    Vector --> Shape["Shape/region comparison<br/>focus, boundary, abstention, urgency"]
